                                <tr class="dataRow" width="100%"> <td width="70%">2. What actions does your county take to support families prior to determining non-cooperation of ATS has occurred?</td><td width="30%">{!CountyPlan.ELIGIBILITY_Q7_2__c}</td></tr>
